Subject: [PATCH] browser: load Aequera shell chrome from browser/aequera

Why Firefox source must change:
  Aequera's shell stylesheet, window glue, and default prefs live in
  aequera/shell/firefox (Aequera source), synced to browser/aequera by the
  "shell-chrome" overlay. Firefox only builds directories listed in
  browser/moz.build, only loads window stylesheets/scripts that
  browser.xhtml names, and only packages pref files listed in the package
  manifest. These three hooks are the minimum to reach them.

What it changes (4 lines, no behavior of its own):
  - browser/moz.build: DIRS += "aequera"
  - browser/base/content/browser.xhtml: link aequera-shell.css (last, so
    equal-specificity Aequera rules win); load aequera-shell.js after
    browser-main.js
  - browser/installer/package-manifest.in: package aequera-prefs.js

Depends on: overlay "shell-chrome" (patches/manifest.yaml).
Validation: artifact build + run (tools/build/README.md); expected: vertical
  hover rail, page card clips back as the rail widens, no console errors
  from aequera-shell.js.
Upstream risk: low. Conflicts only if these exact lines move (DIRS list,
  stylesheet/script block in browser.xhtml head, pref section of the
  package manifest).

diff --git a/browser/base/content/browser.xhtml b/browser/base/content/browser.xhtml
index ba48e8a2be64..ebd4993f0ee8 100644
--- a/browser/base/content/browser.xhtml
+++ b/browser/base/content/browser.xhtml
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@
     rel="stylesheet"
     href="chrome://global/content/resistfingerprinting/letterboxing.css"
   />
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="chrome://browser/content/aequera/aequera-shell.css" />
 
   <link rel="localization" href="branding/brand.ftl"/>
   <link rel="localization" href="browser/allTabsMenu.ftl"/>
@@ -111,6 +112,7 @@
 
   <script src="chrome://browser/content/global-scripts.js"></script>
   <script src="chrome://browser/content/browser-main.js"></script>
+  <script src="chrome://browser/content/aequera/aequera-shell.js"></script>
 </head>
 <html:body xmlns="http://www.mozilla.org/keymaster/gatekeeper/there.is.only.xul">
 # All sets except for popupsets (commands, keys, and stringbundles)
diff --git a/browser/installer/package-manifest.in b/browser/installer/package-manifest.in
index 46725ca04985..a211f835251c 100644
--- a/browser/installer/package-manifest.in
+++ b/browser/installer/package-manifest.in
@@ -268,6 +268,7 @@
 ; All the pref files must be part of base to prevent migration bugs
 @RESPATH@/browser/@PREF_DIR@/firefox.js
 @RESPATH@/browser/@PREF_DIR@/firefox-branding.js
+@RESPATH@/browser/@PREF_DIR@/aequera-prefs.js
 @RESPATH@/greprefs.js
 @RESPATH@/defaults/autoconfig/prefcalls.js
 @RESPATH@/browser/defaults/permissions
diff --git a/browser/moz.build b/browser/moz.build
index 5a03cfc6d3f8..373fc5228cd7 100644
--- a/browser/moz.build
+++ b/browser/moz.build
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ DIRS += [
     "themes",
     "extensions",
     "branding",
+    "aequera",
 ]
 
 DIRS += [
